BEGIN:VEVENT
SUMMARY:No Kings! Rise Up - Sing Out Watch Party
DTSTART;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20260614T153000
DTEND;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20260614T183000
UID:4a5ee83afff192f4845ca8f45ab853f3@mobilize.us
ATTACH;FMTTYPE=image/jpeg:https://mobilize-uploads-prod.s3.amazonaws.com/u
 ploads/event/Fix%20Mobile%20Image%20Cropping%201200%C3%97630%20%281200%20x
 %20630%20px%29_20260601004853886778.png
DESCRIPTION:WHAT: Indivisible Sonoma County will be livestreaming RISE UP 
 -SING OUT\, a concert to celebrate the First Amemdment from Town Hall in N
 YC. This concert will be an uplifting evening of music\, community\, and a
 ction. Hosted by the Committee for the First Amendment (CFA)\, this specia
 l livestream event will feature an all-star lineup including: Jane Fonda\,
  Patti Smith\, Bette Midler\, Rufus Wainwright\, Joy Reid\, Wilson Cruz\, 
 Broadway Inspirational Voices\, and more! PLUS\, in-person\, music by GOOD
  TROUBL
LOCATION:Sebastopol Community Center\, 390 Morris St.\, Sebastopol\, CA\, 
 95472
URL:https://www.mobilize.us/indivisiblesonomacounty/event/964234/
X-SOURCE:Indivisible Sonoma County (Mobilize)
END:VEVENT
